## Recommended Patterns

### Install only

```yaml
- name: Install {{ $cli.Binary }}
  uses: {{ projectOwnGitHubActionsLocation .Specification }}/{{ $install.DirectoryName }}@v0
  with:
    workdir: .tools
```

{{- if .CommandActions }}
{{- $primary := index .CommandActions 0 }}
### Run a subcommand action

```yaml
- name: Run {{ $cli.Binary }} {{ $primary.Subcommand }}
  uses: {{ projectOwnGitHubActionsLocation .Specification }}/{{ $primary.DirectoryName }}@v0
  with:
    # provide the required inputs for this subcommand here
```
{{- end }}

### Dogfood the local action in this repository

```yaml
- name: Dogfood Action
  uses: ./actions/{{ $install.DirectoryName }}
```

The local action path uses the same ref rules. Set `action-ref` to a branch or SHA when the intention is to build the tool from source.

